            "created_at": 1723534586,
            "pk": "17943138641752914",
            "text": "🌟 Unlock your innovative potential with MBRIF! \n\n😎 Are you an innovator looking to take your ideas to the next level? Discover how the Mohammed Bin Rashid Innovation Fund (MBRIF) can support your journey at our upcoming info session!\n\n📅 Date: August 21\n🕒 Time: 15:00\n\nWhy attend?\n🔸 Learn about the Innovation Accelerator and Guarantee Scheme;\n🔸 Explore opportunities for local and international innovators;\n🔸 Network with like-minded individuals and industry experts;\n🔸 Gain insights into the application process and selection criteria.\n\nThe MBRIF, an initiative by the Ministry of Finance, is dedicated to fostering innovation and supporting innovators through two unique programs:\n🔥 Innovation Accelerator: A 6-month program providing access to world-class experts, tailored advice, and insights into business strategy, finance, and market access.\n🔥 Guarantee Scheme: Offers affordable government-backed financing to support business expansion without diluting equity.\n\nMBRIF prioritizes sectors such as Renewable and Clean Energy, Transportation Technology, Education, Health, Water, and Space, aiming to bridge the finance gap and stimulate public and private collaboration in innovation.\n\n🎯 Don’t miss your chance to become part of the UAE’s dynamic innovation ecosystem. Register now using the link in the bio."
